{
  "info": {
    "name": "TSPark API Collection",
    "description": "Complete API collection for TSPark fitness challenge platform.\n\n## User Roles\n- **Super Admin**: Full platform access, manage exercises, approve gyms, manage users\n- **Gym Owner**: Create/manage gyms, create challenges\n- **Client**: Join gyms/challenges, log workouts, social features\n\n## Testing Flow\n1. Start with **0. Health Check** to verify API is running\n2. Run **1. Setup** folder sequentially (register + login all users)\n3. Test features by role:\n   - Super Admin: Exercises, Gym Approval, Badges, Users\n   - Gym Owner: Gyms, Challenges\n   - Client: Join Challenges, Workouts, Social\n4. Test new **Auth Features**: Email Verification, Password Reset\n\n## Variables Auto-saved\nTokens and IDs are automatically saved by test scripts for seamless flow.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health Check",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Check if the API is running. Run this first!",
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:3000/health",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost:3000"],
              "path": ["health"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Setup - User Registration & Login",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Register New User (Test Registration)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "description": "**Test user registration endpoint.**\n\nNote: Public registration always creates CLIENT role.\nSuper Admin and Gym Owner roles are created via seeder (npm run seed).\n\nThis request tests the registration flow with a new user.",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"newuser@tspark.com\",\n  \"password\": \"NewUser123!\",\n  \"firstName\": \"New\",\n  \"lastName\": \"User\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('superAdminUserId', jsonData.data.user.id);",
                  "    console.log('Super Admin created:', jsonData.data.user.email);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
